  "description": "# SIP5.7: Multi-Chain Raft Address Update\n\n## Summary\nThis proposal updates the raft address on all active chains in the Lazy Summer Protocol ecosystem.\n\n## Motivation\nThe raft contract is used to handle reward token auctions. It updates the Raft contract to handle tokens with self transfer functionality blocked.\n\nNewly deployed raft contracts:\n- base: 0x95107E3C932865733e8feCF971e9051DA62FE59A\n- arbitrum: 0x2E6FBcefA0480cF9f7920d98804A9BD72e1eFEc9\n- mainnet: 0xB8BBC85cEE0ea08Cf35B63c23bfE95fA444C5F07\n- sonic: 0xd03414b3E3463DDC471555850F6BdD5322b97d60\n\n## Specifications\n\n### Actions\n1. On base: \n   - Set raft address on base to 0x95107E3C932865733e8feCF971e9051DA62FE59A\n2. Send cross-chain proposal to arbitrum to:\n   - Set raft address on arbitrum to 0x2E6FBcefA0480cF9f7920d98804A9BD72e1eFEc9\n2. Send cross-chain proposal to mainnet to:\n   - Set raft address on mainnet to 0xB8BBC85cEE0ea08Cf35B63c23bfE95fA444C5F07\n2. Send cross-chain proposal to sonic to:\n   - Set raft address on sonic to 0xd03414b3E3463DDC471555850F6BdD5322b97d60\n\n## Technical Details\nThe raft contract is used to handle reward token auctions. It updates the Raft contract to handle tokens with self transfer functionality blocked.",
